      "writtenOn": "2024-08-15T07:24:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want both code on system partition(netd - native code) and code on apex(connectivity) refer the same flag. If a flag is defined to the different containers, can both(netd \u0026 connectivity) can see the same value for the flag?",
