      "message": "Thanks for the explanation.\n\nI updated CL to use exported mode.\n\nBy the way, It seems @FlaggedApi annotation is required for \u0027Exported Mode\u0027 based on \u0027Flag Containers\u0027 g3doc(https://g3doc.corp.google.com/company/teams/android-core-experiments/trunk-stable/flag-containers.md?cl\u003dhead). \nHowever, we don\u0027t have @FlaggedApi usage for this flag. We will use this flag just to synchronize operation between system module(netd) \u0026 mainline module(Connectivity).\n\nCan we share this flag with \u0027Exported Mode\u0027 without @FlaggedApi?",
